  "goodToKnow": "Kühn means bold or daring, a bit literary: ein kühner Entwurf, eine kühne These. The everyday idiom is nicht in meinen kühnsten Träumen (not in my wildest dreams). Die Kühnheit is boldness or audacity. Don't confuse it with kühl (cool): only one letter apart. Everyday synonyms: mutig (brave), gewagt (risky), wagemutig. It's also a common German surname."
